Vendored browser dependencies
-----------------------------

The following third-party assets are served from `static/vendor/` so that an
installation works offline and does not depend on a third-party CDN at runtime.
Each remains under its own license:

  PixiJS 8.17.0              MIT             static/vendor/pixi.min.js
  marked 12.0.2              MIT             static/vendor/marked.min.js
  DOMPurify 3.1.6            Apache-2.0 OR MPL-2.0
                                             static/vendor/purify.min.js
  EasyMDE                    MIT             static/vendor/easymde/
  Phosphor Icons 2.1.2       MIT             static/vendor/phosphor/

The Phosphor stylesheets were reduced to their woff2 `@font-face` source; no
glyph or selector was altered.
